      "text": "# ---------- extended record (base + post-2500 continuation, deterministic) ----------\n_parts = [ (bts, B[0], B[1]) ]\nfor pref in ['cont_r1', 'cont_r3b']:\n    ts, F0, F1, _ = load_group(pref)\n    if len(ts): _parts.append((ts, F0, F1))\n_at = np.concatenate([p[0] for p in _parts])\n_a0 = np.concatenate([p[1] for p in _parts]); _a1 = np.concatenate([p[2] for p in _parts])\norder = np.argsort(_at); _at = _at[order]; _a0 = _a0[order]; _a1 = _a1[order]\nuniq = np.concatenate([[True], np.diff(_at) > 0])\nets, E = _at[uniq], {0: _a0[uniq], 1: _a1[uniq]}\nPOST_END = float(ets[-1])\n_spl = {}\ndef rec_interp(dev, t):\n    if dev not in _spl:\n        _spl[dev] = CubicSpline(ets, E[dev].reshape(len(ets), -1), axis=0)\n    t = float(np.clip(t, ets[0], ets[-1]))\n    return _spl[dev](t).reshape(13, NS[dev])"
